{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Import model"},"description":"Upload a self-contained GLB/glTF model and draft a building, park, square or lake (kind) with its actual projected mesh footprint placed at center and rotation. A CityGML or CityJSON file with one building (kind building) is converted to the same GLB the site makes and stands where its file puts it, so it needs no center. A space keeps the model in structureProposal modelUrl/modelName/rotation/source. kind furniture only checks the asset against the furniture limits (triangles, texture size, bytes) and uploads it, returning asset {modelUrl, name} and no design; center and rotation are not used. Assign it with ugt_edit_design at /structureProposal/decorationDesign/models/<kind> = {url, name}. The model asset is durable and public; confirmAssetUpload=true requires user authorization. Any design stays private.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"center":{"description":"Required for a glTF model unless kind is furniture; a CityGML or CityJSON building brings its own.","items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"maximum":180,"minimum":-180,"type":"number"},{"maximum":85,"minimum":-85,"type":"number"}],"type":"array"},"city":{"description":"Required unless kind is furniture.","maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"confirmAssetUpload":{"const":true,"type":"boolean"},"fileName":{"maxLength":250,"type":"string"},"kind":{"default":"building","enum":["building","park","square","lake","furniture"],"type":"string"},"modelData":{"maxLength":14680064,"type":"string"},"parcelSourceId":{"maxLength":3507,"type":"string"},"rotation":{"default":0,"maximum":360,"minimum":-360,"type":"number"},"title":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["confirmAssetUpload"],"type":"object"},"name":"ugt_import_mode